    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NINA: We'd like to get married next month but the house won't be rebuilt until September.\nSALLY: Then you'll get married right here.\nNINA: Oh, no.\nSALLY: I insist.",
      "NINA: Until after. You keep one empty chair for me during the meal.\nSALLY: I think it's a charming custom.",
      "NINA: Of course not. It's gypsy. We've done it for centuries.\nSALLY: How's your main course coming?\nNINA: I've been letting it cool. It should be done now.\nSALLY: I can't wait to try it.",
      "AUDREY: That slut! Give me some of that cheese cake.\nSALLY: I'm getting the camera.",
      "SALLY: I wanted to age like Katherine Hepburn.\nAUDREY: We forgot to say goodbye to th children!"
    ]
